name: Erratic Six Spike — many 6s
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Sixes, a 25% rank spike for Even Steven,
  X-of-a-kind hands, and screenshot-y repeated-rank starts. RAG aliases: erratic sixes,
  many 6s, all sixes, six-of-kind feeling, funny rank clump.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Six
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: EvenSteven
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: TheTrio
    label: "Three of a Kind payoff from Six density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Four/Five of a Kind payoff from Six density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: SpareTrousers
    label: "Two Pair/Full House lines from rank clumps"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
